"Military / Draft Debate", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) A California National Guardsman\u2019s lawsuit against the Pentagon challenging the stop-loss policy noted.   (Washington: Jim Stewart) The debate over reinstating the draft examined. [Draft Board volunteer Phil CASE&#134;- notes most kids don\u2019t know the Draft Board exists.] [College student Marcus TROMBETTA&#134;- explains his perception of the draft.] [Selective Service System acting director Jack MARTIN&#134;- comments on including college students in the draft.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63360.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762577, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-18", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1660, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762574, "segment_id": "XCL3azNvQV", "segment_broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "segment_title": "Hurricane Charley / Florida / Aftermath", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) Death toll from Hurricane Charley cited.   (Fort Myers Beach, Florida: Jim Acosta) The chaos in the aftermath of the storm featured; details given of fears of an outbreak of disease, accidents & price gouging; scenes shown of residents returning to their barrier island homes, many of which were looted. [Fort Myers Beach resident Rick SAVASTIO&#134;- comments.] [Looting victim Donald FORD&#134;- complains.] [Emergency worker John CAPRIO&#134;- says people are going to make mistakes they normally wouldn\u2019t make.] [Florida state trooper Dominique JONES&#134;- describes an accident at a downed traffic signal.] [Florida attorney general Charlie CRIST&#134;- comments on price gouging.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63500.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762578, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-18", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1660, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762574, "segment_id": "2df5ckEzcZ", "segment_broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items; fallen hero Army Capt. Humayun Khan&#134<!-- spelling on screen --> profiled. (Studio: Scott Pelley; Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63630.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762579, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-18", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1660, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762574, "segment_id": "5WrkuVUmDb", "segment_broadcast_id": "OAVhMY5smA", "segment_title": "(Commercial: OneTouch Ultra; Thompson\u2019s Water Seal; Alka-Seltzer; Viagra; Capital One; Pantene.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63680.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762580, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_r